{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"863aa7b1543849e3cfd2c559a4715af74ecbeb9dde4c86853162816b04e9f732","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米詢問耶和華"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，我與你爭辯的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你顯為義；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但有一件，我還要與你理論：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惡人的道路為何亨通呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大行詭詐的為何得安逸呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你栽培了他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們也扎了根，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"長大，而且結果。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的口是與你相近，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心卻與你遠離。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你曉得我，看見我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"察驗我向你是怎樣的心。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你將他們拉出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像將宰的羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫他們等候殺戮的日子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這地悲哀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"通國的青草枯乾，要到幾時呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因其上居民的惡行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牲畜和飛鳥都滅絕了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們曾說：他看不見我們的結局。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：你若與步行的人同跑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尚且覺累，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"怎能與馬賽跑呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在平安之地，雖然安穩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在約旦河邊的叢林要怎樣行呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為連你弟兄和你父家都用奸詐待你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們也在你後邊大聲喊叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖向你說好話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你也不要信他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華為他的子民憂傷"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"我離了我的殿宇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撇棄我的產業，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將我心裏所親愛的交在她仇敵的手中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的產業向我如林中的獅子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她發聲攻擊我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此我恨惡她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的產業向我豈如斑點的鷙鳥呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鷙鳥豈在她四圍攻擊她呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要去聚集田野的百獸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帶來吞吃吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"許多牧人毀壞我的葡萄園，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"踐踏我的分，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我美好的分變為荒涼的曠野。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們使地荒涼；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地既荒涼，便向我悲哀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全地荒涼，因無人介意。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"滅命的都來到曠野中一切淨光的高處；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的刀從地這邊直到地那邊盡行殺滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡有血氣的都不得平安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們種的是麥子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收的是荊棘；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勞勞苦苦卻毫無益處。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因耶和華的烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必為自己的土產羞愧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華對以色列鄰國的許諾"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["耶和華如此說：「一切惡鄰，就是佔據我使百姓以色列所承受產業的，我要將他們拔出本地，又要將猶大家從他們中間拔出來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["我拔出他們以後，我必轉過來憐憫他們，把他們再帶回來，各歸本業，各歸故土。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["他們若殷勤學習我百姓的道，指着我的名起誓說：『我指着永生的耶和華起誓』，正如他們從前教我百姓指着巴力起誓，他們就必建立在我百姓中間。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["他們若是不聽，我必拔出那國，拔出而且毀滅。這是耶和華說的。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}